 TestExecuteTerminateWinnerTracksCurrentLease |\n212|\n213|## Mutation battery\n214|\n215|`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py`:\n216|73 narrowing rows KILLED, 2 supplementary additive rows KILLED\n217|(D-background-fallback and D-background-fallback-foreground, labeled),\n218|1 harmless control SURVIVED, on two full passes with identical verdicts\n219|and one raw log per plant per run. Row N-deps-foreground kills by\n220|panic: the admitted request calls the nil spawner and the panic fails\n221|the test. Rows N-verify-absence-detail (background leg),\n222|N-broker-empty-generation, and N-commit-eacces-as-exist kill by reroute\n223|to a neighboring refusal, disclosed in their row notes.\n224|N-absence-remap-widen kills through the top-level custody oracle:\n225|under the errors.As helper the row survives (the reviewer's R05),\n226|under the top-level assertion it kills. N-details-constructor kills by\n227|typed-nil: the swallowed constructor failure returns a typed-nil\n228|*axerror.Error inside a non-nil error interface where the test expects\n229|the invalid-arguments refusal, and the top-level type assertion\n230|reddens. N-session-entry kills\n231|through the no-directory/no-probe assertions while the refusal code\n232|stays correct (the spawn-site arm still refuses the admitted member).\n233|No token-preserving source-text mutant applies: no gate inspects source\n234|text, and the harness executes the behavioral suite (bound B4). The\n235|reviewers' error-arm plants (stat-failure arms flipped to fail-open,\n236|the unreachable guard arm, the unopenable-root arm) are reported as\n237|error-arm rows under bound B15, never counted among the narrowing\n238|rows.\n239|\n240|Second leaf: 213 narrowing rows KILLED net (216 added over the\n241|73-row checkpoint harness, 3 reclassified to supplementary: 2\n242|wiring in revision 7, 1 shadowed in revision 8), 4 supplementary\n243|rows added (2 wiring, 1 rotation, 1 shadowed), 1 harmless control\n244|SURVIVED (shared), on the full pass with one raw log per plant —\n245|293 rows total: 286 narrowing KILLED, 5 supplementary KILLED, 1\n246|supplementary SURVIVED (shadowed), 1 control SURVIVED.\n247|Rows N-lifecycle-entry-deadline-terminate and -restore kill by the\n248|no-bind assertion (the loop recheck would refuse the same verdict);\n249|row N-entry-generation patches two sites and kills through both\n250|subtests, attribution verified per subtest from the raw log. Rows\n251|N-bind-mismatch-map, N-replay-corrupt-image, N-stop-escalation-kill,\n252|N-bodies-entrypoint-string, and N-bind-hook-found kill by reroute to\n253|a neighboring verdict, disclosed in their row notes. Multi-entry rows\n254|(cmdvector-attach, vector-detached, the status contradiction rows,\n255|directive-unknown, both scrub rows, length-boundary, present-stopped,\n256|boundary-timeout, verify-absence-detail, boundary-blocking,\n257|readonly-vector, quiesce-detach, unmarked-exit, alias-skip,\n258|boundexit, wrapper-reorder-refresh, the EachOperation custody\n259|rows, the three shared within-effect arms, the shared wait bound)\n260|kill through every claimed entry, attribution verified\n261|per test from the raw logs. The six custody-entry rows share one\n262|killer test but kill through one subtest each (single-entry rows);\n263|the attach row additionally kills through its valid-body test. The\n264|shared within-effect arm rows kill through the stop and quiesce\n265|killers while the other-fact subtests stay green; the shared wait\n266|row kills through the attach, quiesce, and boundary deadline tests\n267|while the cancellation companion stays green; the per-site skip\n268|rows kill through their own entry while the other members stay\n269|green. Row D-attach-entry-deadline-shadowed survives by reroute:\n270|the wait bound refuses the admitted instant with the same verdict\n271|before any admission runs, so the entry arm is fail-fast\n272|redundancy pinned behaviorally, not a