ep's (TASK-260830-1c28dz), which is the step\n802|  that binds. This leaf pins the root handle (no-follow open plus\n803|  handle/path binding) and commits the leaf relative to it; a\n804|  world-writable root is admitted here and refused at bind. That the\n805|  root value is the landed localstore PathRuntime is a contract\n806|  statement about the caller, not a driven fact: no test composes\n807|  localstore with Acquire.\n808|- B20 Whether the runtime leaf was created by AX is indistinguishable\n809|  after the fact: any same-user 0700 directory under an admitted name\n810|  is accepted. The verifiable properties — mode, ownership, kind,\n811|  containment — are gated (rows 1-15); provenance is not claimed.\n812|- B21 No broker is modelled as the zero BrokerReport, whose\n813|  Principal.UID is 0: for a non-root process the absent broker\n814|  refuses on the authentication arm, while under a root process the\n815|  same-user arm passes and refusal comes from the generation arm.\n816|  The broker-path outcome socket binding is the generation equality\n817|  only — BrokerReport carries no socket of its own.\n818|- B22 Singleton arms ship no narrowing mutant: admitting the\n819|  singleton refused member is deleting the gate. Covered sites, each\n820|  test-pinned in both directions where a fork exists: create relay\n821|  transport (relay), descriptor presence fork (descpresence),\n822|  attach admission nil (serveadmitnil), spawner runner nil\n823|  (spawnnil), reconcile verifier nil (reconcilenil), states root\n824|  empty (stateopen), persist/attach stores nil (storenil),\n825|  failed-kill self-confirm (selfconfirm), live-after-escalation\n826|  (stoptimeout), and post-wait boundaries without a configured\n827|  revalidation (recheckPostWait nil). The outcome-lookup empty-key\n828|  arm left this bound: it narrows now (LookupOutcomeRefusesForgedKey /\n829|  N-outcome-key-forged). Owner: this leaf; retest if any site\n830|  grows a second refused member.\n831|