 blocked within the hour past the shared read-only probe bound (the stop poll, terminate confirm, and status probes each wait an hour long); answered probes still follow the clock and caller cancellation still cancels. One shared site, three entries: each deadline test reddens alone (isolated attribution from single-test runs), because each verdict lands at the release instead of the bound. [exit 1]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1341,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 336,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
