rizes. | executeTerminate, mapFencingError | TestExecuteTerminateRefusals, TestExecuteTerminateTargetLeaseIdentity, TestExecuteTerminateTargetSessionBinds, TestExecuteTerminateWinnerTracksCurrentLease |\n150|\n151|## Gate × entry census (mirrored from TRACEABILITY)\n152|\n153|Table A (first leaf, 24 × 11) is frozen and unchanged; only\n154|row N-verify-absence-detail widened its killer mask to the new\n155|entries (old cells unchanged). Tables B/C/D/E below are copied\n156|verbatim from the package TRACEABILITY, whose counts were\n157|verified by script over the tables.\n158|## Second-leaf census\n159|\n160|New columns: EXC/EXA/EXS/EXE/EXT/EXR = Execute create, attach,\n161|status, engine ops (quiesce/boundary/stop), terminate-stale, restore;\n162|PRB = ServerProber.Probe, SPW = ServerSpawner.Spawn, DIAL =\n163|UnixDialer.Dial, CMD = BuildCommand, DIRV = DirectivesFor, PDIR =\n164|ParseDirective, LEN = CheckSocketLength, CUS = CheckSocketCustody,\n165|REC/LOOK = InstanceStates Record/Lookup (including the RecordOutcome/RecordBindingDoc/RecordIncarnation writes and the LookupOutcome/LookupBindingDoc/LookupIncarnation reads), CLS = ClassifyStatus, OBSP =\n166|ObserveStatus called directly, PFX = PerformEffect called directly,\n167|OSR = OSRunner called directly, UNT = unexported internals called\n168|directly in unit tests (body parsers, rowError, providerTriple,\n169|cutRow, ReconcileAdmission). Cell codes M/U1/U2/U3/B as above, with\n170|U2 reasons tagged: U2a = entry never calls this code (the retired\n171|U2b, reachable-but-undriven, is bound B39 now: those cells state\n172|what the committed tests drive, with the narrowed direction\n173|measured at the listed entry); U2c = reachable only through\n174|caller-injected\n175|Production Dependencies with no committed composition test (bound\n176|B27).\n177|\n178|Table B: old gates × new entries (24 × 21 = 504 cells; 10 M, 494\n179|U2a). Only the verify side (via custody delegation) and the server\n180|attestation (via