are bound outside this split.)\n470|\n471|Table E: after-restore outcome grid (ExecuteWrapperRestore,\n472|wrapper.go:97). Each row is one decided outcome with its evidence\n473|condition, its backend effect, and the committed test plus the\n474|narrowing row that kills a routing/order mutant through the\n475|wrapper entry (test names drop the Test prefix):\n476|\n477|| Outcome | Evidence condition | Backend effect | Test / row |\n478||---|---|---|---|\n479|| launch | verified local win + valid materialization | executes backend restore exactly once | WrapperRestoreLocalWinResumes; reorder covered by N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n480|| reattach | verified local win + recorded bootstrap pair | executes backend restore exactly once | WrapperRestoreReattachReplaysBackend; reorder covered by N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n481|| attach_remote | refreshed remote winner + lapsed local grant + interactive | none (no backend op, no exec, no provider) | WrapperRestoreLapsedGrantRemoteOffer/attach; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n482|| takeover_offer | refreshed remote winner + lapsed local grant + non-capable attach | none (no backend op, no exec, no provider) | WrapperRestoreLapsedGrantRemoteOffer/takeover; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n483|| parked (remote-noninteractive) | refreshed remote winner + non-interactive terminal | none | WrapperRestoreParksWithoutEffects/remote-noninteractive; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n484|| parked (refresh-failed) | refresh error → unverified local knowledge | none | WrapperRestoreParksWithoutEffects/refresh-failed; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n485|| parked (no-adapter) | missing refresh adapter → unverified local knowledge | none | WrapperRestoreParksWithoutEffects/no-adapter; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n486|| parked (no-known-lease) | no lease known at all → zero winner | none | WrapperRestoreParksWithoutEffects/no-known-lease; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n487|| parked (invalid-material) | required materialization not admitted | none (routing mutant would execute) | WrapperRestoreParksWithoutEffects/invalid-material; N-wrapper-route-material |\n488|| parked (refresh-timeout) | refresh blocks → cancelled at the bound, unverified | none | WrapperRestoreRefreshBoundMeasured/configured-50ms; N-refresh-bound-default (default leg) |\n489|| parked (expired refresh) | refresh answers after the deadline with a nil error → rejected, unverified | none | WrapperRestoreExpiredRefreshParksUnverified; expiry covered by N-wrapper-refresh-expired |\n490|| parked (late-answer race) | both-ready selection → the late answer never verifies | none | WrapperRestoreRefreshRaceRejectsLateAnswer; N-wrapper-refresh-expired |\n491|| parked (non-cooperative adapter) | adapter ignores cancellation → the entry returns at the bound | none | WrapperRestoreRefreshBoundEnforced; N-wrapper-refresh-deadline |\n492|| refuse (divergent winner) | refreshed winner ≠ carried restore authorization | none, failed local precondition | WrapperRestoreRefusesDivergentWinner(+Lease,+Epoch); N-wrapper-winner-lease, N-wrapper-winner-epoch |\n493|| refuse (divergent session) | decision session ≠ restore session | none, failed local precondition | WrapperRestoreRefusesDivergentSession; N-wrapper-restore-session |\n494|| refuse (divergent bootstrap) | decision bootstrap ≠ restore bootstrap | none, failed local precondition | ReviewWrapperBootstrapMustBindExecutedRestore; N-wrapper-restore-bootstrap |\n495|| refuse (divergent instance) | admitted descriptor instance ≠ restore instance | none, failed local precondition | ReviewWrapperInstanceMustBindExecutedRestore; N-wrapper-restore-instance |\n496|| refuse (divergent backend) | admitted descriptor backend ≠ restore backend | none, failed local precondition | WrapperRestoreRefusesDivergentBackend; N-wrapper-restore-backend |\n497|| refuse (divergent generation) | admitted descriptor generation ≠ restore generation | none, failed local precondition | WrapperRestoreRefusesDivergentGeneration; N-wrapper-restore-generation |\n498|| refuse (mode) | Decide.Mode != restore (incl. garbage) | none, invalid-arguments | WrapperRestoreRefusesMalformed; N-wrapper-mode |\n499|| refuse (operation) | Restore.Operation != restore (incl. garbage) | none, invalid-arguments | WrapperRestoreRefusesMalformed; N-wrapper-operation |\n500|| refuse (deps) | nil lifecycle or nil dependency | none, protocol-error | WrapperRestoreRefusesMalformed; B36 singleton (no narrowing row) |\n501|\n502|The refresh runs before the decision on every row (N-wrapper-\n503|reorder-refresh admits exactly the fixture session past the\n504|refresh-success arm into stale local knowledge and is killed by\n505|the offer/resume/park tests together), so the offer path never\n506|presents the lapsed grant to backend restore authorization. The\n507|resume rows execute only bound to the decided session, bootstrap,\n508|instance, backend, generation, and winner as one composed\n509|authorization (N-wrapper-restore-session, N-wrapper-restore-\n510|bootstrap, N-wrapper-restore-instance, N-wrapper-restore-backend,\n511|N-wrapper-restore-generation, N-wrapper-winner-lease,\n512|N-wrapper-winner-epoch); late answers never verify whether they\n513|arrive after the deadline (N-wrapper-refresh-expired) or the\n514|adapter ignores cancellation (N-wrapper-refresh-deadline). No\n515|production mesh transport backs the adapter (B37). Union-rival\n516|ambiguity is unmodeled (B38). The parked wire result\n517|of the backend restore entry itself (RestoredParked) stays a\n518|backend-row concern, not a Table E row.\n519|\n520|## Bounds (mirrored B22-B44 plus carried dispositions)\n521|\n522|- B22 Singleton arms ship no narrowing mutant: admitting the\n523|  singleton refused member is deleting the gate. Covered sites, each\n524|  test-pinned in both directions where a fork exists: create relay\n525|  transport (relay), descriptor presence fork (descpresence),\n526|  attach admission nil (serveadmitnil), spawner runner nil\n527|  (spawnnil), reconcile verifier nil (reconcilenil), states root\n528|  empty (stateopen), persist/attach stores nil (storenil),\n529|  failed-kill self-confirm (selfconfirm), live-after-escalation\n530|  (stoptimeout), and post-wait boundaries without a configured\n531|  revalidation (recheckPostWait nil). The outcome-lookup empty-key\n532|  arm left this bound: it narrows now (LookupOutcomeRefusesForgedKey /\n533|  N-outcome-key-forged). Owner: this leaf; retest if any site\n534|  grows a second refused member.\n535|- B23 The landed status engine normalizes backend error details to\n536|  \"status observation unknown\" (coded or not), so the cutrow and\n537|  empty-panes narrowings measure at the helper entries while the\n538|  dispatch legs pin the code. Owner: this leaf; retest if the\n539|  engine stops normalizing.\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
