{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e8d7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c9a4-cdaf-7691-9123-20534004d71c"},"sequence":4806,"recorded_at":1780531400009607,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"7d4d0da9-54d0-407b-9491-ce60f372e27f","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"7d4d0da9-54d0-407b-9491-ce60f372e27f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"7d4d0da9-54d0-407b-9491-ce60f372e27f"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\nRev9 closes all five verdict-rev8 findings. The candidate is uncommitted in the Story worktree (49 paths, HEAD still `d4bd91d0`).\n\nWhat changed:\n- **P1 (fail-open census):** `Peers` now skips only staging/non-receipt names; a directory at a receipt-shaped name errors and the attach refuses. Entry test + census test, two narrowings KILLED (one cross-package plant).\n- **P2-A (unbounded poll):** one shared `probeContext` bounds the stop poll, terminate confirm, and status probes in-flight; expiry concludes unknown, never a verdict. Three release-controlled entry tests (refusal ~200ms vs 1s release, no kill/closure/termination/report); shared `N-probe-deadline` kills through each entry alone. Full runner audit: all other waits/probes already bounded; single-shot commits stay caller-cancellation-bounded as stated bound B45.\n- **P2-B (replay refused):** a Lookup-proven recorded receipt exempts the identical retry with a peer present (input + read-only shapes); conflicting retries still refuse `idempotency_mismatch`. Narrowing KILLED.\n- **P2-D (attribution):** fixtures now drive the admitted class; every shared plant kills through every claimed killer alone, twice — stop 4/quiesce 4 and 4 wait killers measured, with subtest precision in the raw logs.\n- **P2-C (stale archive):** fresh 3.7 MB / 648-entry tarball built from the frozen tree, attached by absolute path, read back and digest-verified (`fa7b00c2…` matches on both sides).\n\nEvidence: 296/296 + 42/42 battery rows as expected on two full passes each; census mechanically verified at 148 gates, 266 measured of 5504 (pollbound measured, terminate tail corrected U1→B39); composition clean (2894 shared suite verdicts retained, 0 moved; 28/28 entry corpus identical); 30/30 validation suite green plus windows vet. Matrix mirrors TRACEABILITY byte-identically (script-checked). Checklist 25/25 at handoff; items 16 (no source-text gate in this leaf) and 25 (pending review) resolved by the handoff itself.","reason":null}}
